{
  "info": {
    "name": "ToursPostgreSQL",
    "description": "# ToursPostgreSQL API\n\nProfessional REST API for the Tours system backed by PostgreSQL and Prisma.\n\n---\n\n## Endpoints Overview\n\n| Service | Base Route | Key Features |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Tours** | `/api/v1/tours` | CRUD, GeoSpatial (tours-within, distances), Stats, Monthly Plan |\n| **Users** | `/api/v1/users` | Auth (signup, login), Profile (updateMe), Password Reset |\n| **Reviews** | `/api/v1/reviews` | CRUD, Nested on Tours |\n\n---\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:4000/api/v1`\n- `token`: Bearer access token for users\n- `adminToken`: Bearer access token for admin\n- `tourId`: Created/selected tour ID\n- `reviewId`: Created/selected review ID\n- `userEmail`: Generated email for testing",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tourId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "reviewId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userEmail",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth & Users",
      "description": "User authentication and profile management.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Signup",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userEmail', 'user_' + Date.now() + '@test.com');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Success envelope', function () { pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true; });",
                  "if (res.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Test User\",\n    \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n    \"password\": \"test1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/signup",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "signup"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Success envelope', function () { pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true; });",
                  "if (res.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', res.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@natours.io\",\n    \"password\": \"test1234\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tours",
      "description": "Tour CRUD and Geospatial.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Tours",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Success envelope', function () { pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true; });",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.length > 0) { pm.collectionVariables.set('tourId', res.data[0].id); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tours",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tours"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Tour",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tours/{{tourId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tours",
                "{{tourId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tours Within",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tours/tours-within/250/center/34.111745,-118.113491/unit/mi",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tours",
                "tours-within",
                "250",
                "center",
                "34.111745,-118.113491",
                "unit",
                "mi"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Distances",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tours/distances/34.111745,-118.113491/unit/mi",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tours",
                "distances",
                "34.111745,-118.113491",
                "unit",
                "mi"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tour Stats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tours/tour-stats",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "tours",
                "tour-stats"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reviews",
      "description": "Review CRUD.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Reviews",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reviews",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reviews"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Review",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('reviewId', res.data.id); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"review\": \"Amazing tour!\",\n    \"rating\": 5,\n    \"tourId\": {{tourId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/reviews",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "reviews"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}